ive\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- tool rail -->\n  <div id=\"rail\">\n    <button class=\"tool on\" aria-label=\"Select tool\" title=\"Select\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M3 1l8.5 6-3.6.9L10 12l-1.9.9-2.1-4.1L3.4 11z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"tool\" aria-label=\"Split tool\" title=\"Split\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M7 1v12M4 3.5L7 7l3-3.5M4 10.5L7 7l3 3.5\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"tool\" aria-label=\"Zoom tool\" title=\"Zoom\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" d=\"M9.2 9.2L13 13\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"tool\" aria-label=\"Pan tool\" title=\"Pan\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 6.5V3a1 1 0 012 0v3M7 6V2.4a1 1 0 012 0V7m0-2.6a1 1 0 012 0V9c0 2.4-1.6 4-4 4S3.5 11.4 3 9.6L2.2 7A1 1 0 014 6.4l1 1.8\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- composer -->\n  <div id=\"composer\">\n    <div id=\"slot\">\n      <svg class=\"splat\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2.6c1.8 0 2.3 2.1 3.8 2.7 1.5.6 3.5-.7 4.5.6 1 1.3-.5 2.9-.2 4.5.3 1.6 2.3 2.3 2 3.9-.3 1.6-2.4 1.5-3.4 2.7-1 1.2-.4 3.3-1.8 4-1.4.7-2.6-1-4.2-1-1.6 0-2.9 1.7-4.3 1-1.4-.7-.7-2.8-1.7-4-1-1.2-3.1-1.1-3.4-2.7-.3-1.6 1.7-2.3 2-3.9.3-1.6-1.2-3.2-.2-4.5 1-1.3 3-.0 4.5-.6C11 4.7 10.2 2.6 12 2.6z\"/></svg>\n      <div id=\"avatarHost\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"askline\">\n      <input id=\"ask\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ask Mosh to…\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"Ask Mosh\">\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"micwrap\">\n      <button id=\"mic\" aria-label=\"Hold to talk to Moshi\" title=\"Hold to talk\">\n        <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"1.2\" width=\"4\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M3.2 6.8a3.8 3.8 0 007.6 0M7 10.6V13M5.2 13h3.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n      <svg id=\"micring\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"28\" r=\"26\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"send\" aria-label=\"Send\" title=\"Send\">\n      <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M1.4 6.2L12.6 1.3c.5-.2 1 .3.8.8L8.5 13.3c-.2.5-.9.5-1.1 0L5.8 9.1a.6.6 0 00-.35-.35L1.4 7.3c-.5-.2-.5-.9 0-1.1z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div id=\"toast\">kept — hook 01 on VOX</div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"hint\">hold <kbd>M</kbd> — or hold the mic — for a word with him</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n\"use strict\";\nvar $=function(s){return document.querySelector(s)};\nvar frame=$(\"#frame\"),lanes=$(\"#lanes\"),input=$(\"#ask\"),mic=$(\"#mic\"),\n    avatarHost=$(\"#avatarHost\"),slot=$(\"#slot\"),bigHost=$(\"#bigHost\"),bigWrap=$(\"#bigWrap\"),\n    caption=$(\"#seanceCap\"),earcons=$(\"#earcons\"),hint=$(\"#hint\"),toast=$(\"#toast\"),\n    pour=$(\"#pour\"),playhead=$(\"#playhead\");\n\n/* ── deterministic clip innards ─────────────────────────────── */\nfunction rng(seed){var s=seed%2147483647;if(s<=0)s+=2147483646;\n  return function(){s=s*16807%2147483647;return (s-1)/2147483646}}\nfunction waveSvg(seed,color){var R=rng(seed),W=200,H=34,n=56,d=\"\";\n  for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var x=(i+0.5)*(W/n);\n    var env=0.35+0.65*Math.sin((i/n)*Math.PI);\n    var a=Math.max(1.2,(0.15+0.85*Math.pow(R(),1.7))*env*H*0.46);\n    d+=\"M\"+x.toFixed(1)+\" \"+(H/2-a).toFixed(1)+\"V\"+(H/2+a).toFixed(1)}\n  return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 '+W+' '+H+'\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"'+d+\n    '\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>'}\nfunction midiSvg(seed){var R=rng(seed),W=200,H=34,rows=7,r=\"\";\n  for(var i=0;i<15;i++){var x=R()*W*0.88,len=10+R()*W*0.16,row=Math.floor(R()*rows);\n    r+='<rect x=\"'+x.toFixed(1)+'\" y=\"'+(2+row*((H-6)/rows)).toFixed(1)+\n       '\" width=\"'+len.toFixed(1)+'\" height=\"3.2\" rx=\"1.6\" fill=\"rgba(196,202,220,.78)\"/>'}\n  return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 '+W+' '+H+'\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">'+r+\"</svg>\"}\nfunction drumSvg(seed){var R=rng(seed),W=200,H=34,n=32,r=\"\";\n  for(var i=0;i<n;i++){if(R()<0.28)continue;var acc=i%4===0;\n    var h=acc?16:7+R()*5,x=(i+0.5)*(W/n);\n    r+='<rect x=\"'+(x-1.1).toFixed(1)+'\" y=\"'+(H-h-2).toFixed(1)+'\" width=\"2.2\" height=\"'+h.toFixed(1)+\n       '\" rx=\"1.1\" fill=\"rgba(204,255,54,'+(acc?\".85\":\".38\")+')\"/>'}\n  return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 '+W+' '+H+'\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">'+r+\"</svg>\"}\nfunction innards(kind,seed){return kind===\"midi\"?midiSvg(seed):kind===\"drum\"?drumSvg(seed):\n  waveSvg(seed,\"rgba(237,237,238,.5)\")}\n\n/* ── build the arrangement ──────────────────────────────────── */\nvar ICONS={\n drum:'<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"4\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.8\"/></svg>',\n bass:'<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M1 7c2-5.4 4-5.4 6 0s4 5.4 6 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>',\n keys:'<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><rect x=\"1.4\" y=\"2\" width=\"3.1\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"5.5\" y=\"2\" width=\"3.1\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"9.6\" y=\"2\" width=\"3.1\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>',\n vox:'<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"1.4\" width=\"4\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3.4 7a3.6 3.6 0 007.2 0M7 10.6V13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>',\n fx:'<svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path d=\"M7 .8l1.5 4.4L13 7 8.5 8.8 7 13.2 5.5 8.8 1 7l4.5-1.8z\"/></svg>'};\nvar TRACKS=[\n {name:\"DRUMS\",chain:\"KIT 9 · punch\",icon:\"drum\",clips:[[\"808 spine\",0,16,\"drum\",11],[\"switch b\",16,32,\"drum\",12]]},\n {name:\"BASS\",chain:\"SUB · glide\",icon:\"bass\",clips:[[\"sub run\",4,16,\"wave\",21],[\"sub run II\",20,28,\"wave\",22]]},\n {name:\"KEYS\",chain:\"RHODES · tape\",icon:\"keys\",clips:[[\"cold keys\",8,16,\"midi\",31],[\"pads · A♭m\",16,24,\"midi\",32]]},\n {name:\"VOX\",chain:\"TAKE 4 · comp\",icon:\"vox\",clips:[[\"pella take 4\",16,24,\"wave\",41]]},\n {name:\"FX\",chain:\"RISER · verb\",icon:\"fx\",clips:[[\"riser\",14,16,\"wave\",51],[\"tail\",24,26,\"wave\",52]]}];\nvar BARS=32,HEAD=168;\nvar html=\"\";\nTRACKS.forEach(function(t,ti){\n  html+='<div class=\"row grow\" data-i=\"'+ti+'\"'+(t.name===\"VOX\"?' id=\"laneVox\"':\"\")+'>'+\n   '<div class=\"rhead\"><span class=\"ticon\">'+ICONS[t.icon]+'</span>'+\n   '<span class=\"tname\"><b>'+t.name+'</b><i>'+t.chain+'</i></span>'+\n   '<span class=\"tside\"><span class=\"ms\">'+\n   '<button class=\"msb m\" aria-label=\"Mute '+t.name+'\">M</button>'+\n   '<button class=\"msb s\" aria-label=\"Solo '+t.name+'\">S</button></span>'+\n   '<span class=\"lvl\"><i></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cliprow\">';\n  t.clips.forEach(function(c){\n    html+='<div class=\"clip '+c[3]+'\" style=\"left:'+(c[1]/BARS*100)+\"%;width:calc(\"+((c[2]-c[1])/BARS*100)+'% - 4px)\">'+\n      '<span class=\"cl\">'+c[0]+'</span>'+innards(c[3],c[4])+\"</div>\"});\n  if(t.name===\"VOX\")\n    html+='<div class=\"clip\" id=\"ghost\" style=\"left:'+(24/BARS*100)+\"%;width:calc(\"+(4/BARS*100)+'% - 4px)\" title=\"click to keep\">'+\n      '<span class=\"cl\">moshi · hook 01 · A♭m</span><span class=\"gwave\"></span></div>';\n  html+=\"</div></div>\"});\nlanes.innerHTML=html;\n\nvar SECTS=[[\"INTRO\",